{"assets":["/statement-assets/bbe246993edf49ef1fced53842ef51ce9351cb6cc7cdb8ce661a329088d68cc4.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"896","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Nephren Runs a Cinema"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2.5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Lakhesh loves to make movies, so Nephren helps her run a cinema. We may call it No. 68 Cinema."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/bbe246993edf49ef1fced53842ef51ce9351cb6cc7cdb8ce661a329088d68cc4.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"However, one day, the No. 68 Cinema runs out of changes (they don't have 50-"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yuan"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" notes currently), but Nephren still wants to start their business. (Assume that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yuan"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a kind of currency in Regulu Ere.)"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are three types of customers: some of them bring exactly a 50-"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yuan"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" note; some of them bring a 100-"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yuan"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" note and Nephren needs to give a 50-"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yuan"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" note back to him/her; some of them bring VIP cards so that they don't need to pay for the ticket."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Now "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" customers are waiting outside in queue. Nephren wants to know how many possible queues are there that they are able to run smoothly (i.e. every customer can receive his/her change), and that the number of 50-"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yuan"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" notes they have after selling tickets to all these customers is between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":", inclusive. Two queues are considered different if there exists a customer whose type is different in two queues. As the number can be large, please output the answer modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One line containing four integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 105)"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ p ≤ 2·109)"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"l"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"r"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0 ≤ l ≤ r ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":"). "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One line indicating the answer modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"p"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 97 2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"13\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 100 0 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"35\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We use A, B and C to indicate customers with 50-"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yuan"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" notes, customers with 100-"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yuan"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" notes and customers with VIP cards respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first sample, the different possible queues that there are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":" 50-"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yuan"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" notes left are AAAB, AABA, ABAA, AACC, ACAC, ACCA, CAAC, CACA and CCAA, and the different possible queues that there are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":" 50-"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yuan"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" notes left are AAAC, AACA, ACAA and CAAA. So there are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"13"},{"kind":"text","text":" different queues satisfying the first sample. Similarly, there are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"35"},{"kind":"text","text":" different queues satisfying the second sample."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"896D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/896/problem/D"}